WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.870
- [Kelly Clarkson] People
don't realize if you

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:03.420
even if you are older and never had kids

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.560
so much going after you have a baby

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:08.580
like not only your body, is just given up.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.240
Um, but your emotional
state is kind of crazy.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.960
So, like somebody
talking to someone that's

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.780
just had a baby in a photo shoot saying,

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:15.670
Oh, you need to lose some weight.

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:18.090
That will send you in a spiral.

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:19.810
- Oh, yeah no the hormones are crazy

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:21.284
and no one talks about it! The hormones

00:00:21.284 --> 00:00:23.961
after pregnancy, for me were crazier

00:00:23.961 --> 00:00:25.458
than when I was pregnant.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:28.127
And it took forever for them to calm down.

00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:30.970
Like, months after breastfeeding,

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:33.005
I mean, uh I think I
might still be hormonal.

00:00:33.005 --> 00:00:34.010
(laughter)

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:35.729
- No, here's my best,
this is my best story

00:00:35.729 --> 00:00:38.059
So, I was, I freaked
out 'cause I had, I was

00:00:38.059 --> 00:00:39.960
pumping so I was working the same time

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:40.920
- Which is the worst!

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:41.753
- Pumping is the worst!

00:00:41.753 --> 00:00:42.586
- The worst!

00:00:42.586 --> 00:00:44.795
- It's so painful! I don't
care what anyone says.

00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:47.275
Anyway, but, somebody
had kind of tossed out

00:00:47.275 --> 00:00:49.890
and it was only a tiny
bit of breast milk left

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:50.723
in the bottle.

00:00:50.723 --> 00:00:51.556
- No! No!

00:00:51.556 --> 00:00:54.520
- [Kelly] I lost my ever
living my, like a crazy person

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:56.639
went in my closet and just bleugh like

00:00:56.639 --> 00:00:57.472
- Oh yah!

00:00:57.472 --> 00:00:58.531
- Collapsed on the floor and was crying

00:00:58.531 --> 00:00:59.760
'cause I was like, you
have no idea how hard

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:01.715
I worked for that. And I was like, really

00:01:01.715 --> 00:01:04.050
there was like nothing in the bottle.

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:05.900
I'm crazy, but it literally it's just

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:07.270
a hormonal period and I don't think people

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:08.690
take that into account, especially when

00:01:08.690 --> 00:01:09.687
we're women in the public eye,

00:01:09.687 --> 00:01:10.520
- Yeah

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:11.790
- [Kelly] Like, it is a hard time.

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:13.213
- And our energy is comp, is literally

00:01:13.213 --> 00:01:15.730
being sucked out of us, so you don't

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:16.975
feel like yourself, you don't

00:01:16.975 --> 00:01:19.019
- Literally, it's being sucked out of you.

00:01:19.019 --> 00:01:20.210
- [Kate] Literally! It's
being sucked out of you.

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:22.165
It is so difficult and something

00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:24.355
people need to talk about more.

00:01:24.355 --> 00:01:27.040
- Um, I hundred percent. I talk about it

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:29.876
any chance I can, I
complain about pregnancy

00:01:29.876 --> 00:01:31.853
and all of that any chance I can.

